  "why": "Units of one kind convert exactly (0044 K2: 1 bar = 100 kPa): the sensor reads in bar and the request limits in kPa. `4.2 bar < 450 kPa` is true, and a model that writes 450 against a bar reading (or 4.5 bar) differs only by a unit. Under 2.1 `pressure` is no kind (E217).",
  "attempt_fails_with": "E217"
